/E (Physiological Society of India \(PSI\) The Physiological Society of India \(physiologicalsocietyofindia.org\) is a pioneering organization dedicated to advancing the field of physiology in India. Established on July 13, 1934, PSI was founded by a group of eminent physicians and scientists, including Sir Nilratan Sarkar, Sir Kedar Nath Das, Sir Upendra Nath Brahmachari, and Dr. Bidhan Chandra Roy, alongside renowned physiologists and biochemists.)
